{"type":"message","id":"c08e954f","parentId":"a38bf2a1","timestamp":"2026-03-14T04:40:08.534Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:8","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md","content":"# Task Status Tracker - 学习记录\n\n记录关于任务跟踪、进度更新、时间估计等方面的学习。\n\n---\n\n## [LRN-20250314-001] 示例模板\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:00:00Z\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: tracking\n\n### Summary\n这是一个示例学习记录，用于展示格式。\n\n### Details\n详细描述学习的内容和背景。\n\n### Suggested Action\n建议采取的行动。\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: conversation\n- Related Files: \n- Tags: example\n\n---\n"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:9","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/.learnings/ERRORS.md","content":"# Task Status Tracker - 错误记录\n\n记录任务状态跟踪、进度更新、时间估计等方面的错误和失败案例。\n\n---\n\n## [ERR-20250314-001] 示例错误模板\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:00:00Z\n**Priority**: high\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: tracking\n\n### Summary\n这是一个示例错误记录，用于展示格式。\n\n### Error\n```\n错误信息或输出\n```\n\n### Context\n- 尝试的操作\n- 使用的参数\n- 环境信息\n\n### Suggested Fix\n建议的修复方法。\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes/no/unknown\n- Related Files: \n\n---\n"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write:10","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md","content":"# Task Status Tracker - 功能请求\n\n记录对任务状态跟踪功能的改进需求和新功能建议。\n\n---\n\n## [FR-20250314-001] 示例功能请求模板\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-14T12:00:00Z\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: tracking\n\n### Summary\n这是一个示例功能请求，用于展示格式。\n\n### Description\n详细描述请求的功能。\n\n### Use Case\n使用场景和用户价值。\n\n### Proposed Implementation\n建议的实现方案。\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: user_feedback\n- Related Files: \n- Tags: enhancement\n\n---\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"o