{"type":"message","id":"13c05332","parentId":"46e8e053","timestamp":"2026-03-14T04:46:05.079Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"任务完成！我已经为两个 skill 配置好了完整的自我提升功能。\n\n## 完成内容总结\n\n### Task 1: orchestrator-constraint skill\n\n**创建的文件：**\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/orchestrator-constraint/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` - 学习记录\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/orchestrator-constraint/.learnings/ERRORS.md` - 错误记录\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/orchestrator-constraint/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md` - 功能请求\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/orchestrator-constraint/EVOLUTION.md` (10.5KB) - 进化规则，包含：\n  - Review→Apply→Report 循环\n  - 触发器（什么时候记录学习）\n  - 决策树（自己执行 vs 派小弟）\n  - 提升规则（什么时候提升到主文档）\n\n### Task 2: task-status-tracker skill\n\n**创建的文件：**\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md` - 学习记录\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/.learnings/ERRORS.md` - 错误记录\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/.learnings/FEATURE_REQUESTS.md` - 功能请求\n- `~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/task-status-tracker/EVOLUTION.md` (9.1KB) - 进化规则，包含：\n  - Review→Apply→Report 循环\n  - 触发器（什么时候记录）\n  - 时间估计改进方法\n  - 提升规则（什么时候改进进度展示方式）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773463547973}}
